@lang en
IMPORT `vn11-art01-02-definitions`

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms, row VN-11: Article 3, the benefits. The only benefit
-- is the death benefit; this module answers "how much" for it. Whether it is payable at all is
-- decided in vn11-death-claim.l4, which reads Arts 1, 4, 5, 9, 10, 11, 16 and 18 as well.

§ `Article 3 — Benefits`

§§ `Art 3(a) — the death benefit`

-- src:77 | Công ty sẽ thanh toán Quyền lợi khi tử vong tùy
-- src:83 | Số tiền bảo hiểm được quy định ở Trang Hợp
-- src:89 | Tất cả các quyền lợi phải trả theo các Điều
-- src:90 | khoản bảo hiểm bổ trợ của Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:93 | iii) Tất cả các khoản phí bảo hiểm chưa đóng.
-- The death benefit is (i) plus (ii) less (iii). Art 3(b) reduces (i) for a young child, and Art 9
-- may correct the sum insured first (vn11-death-claim.l4). Which premiums (iii) deducts is fork F7.
-- "tùy thuộc vào các điều khoản khác của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm" (subject to the other terms): the
-- composition in vn11-death-claim.l4 is where the other terms bite.
@ref Art 3(a), src:76-93
GIVEN `the sum insured`            IS A NUMBER
      `the Age at death`           IS A NUMBER
      `the rider benefits payable` IS A NUMBER
      `the premiums unpaid`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 3(a) — the death benefit` `the sum insured` `the Age at death` `the rider benefits payable` `the premiums unpaid` MEANS
        -- (i) the sum insured, at the percentage Art 3(b) gives for the Age at death; plus
        `Art 3(b) — the percentage of the sum insured for an Age at death of` `the Age at death` TIMES `the sum insured`
        -- (ii) all benefits payable under the riders; less
    PLUS `the rider benefits payable`
        -- (iii) all premiums unpaid
    MINUS `the premiums unpaid`

§§ `Art 3(b) — the limit on the death benefit for a child`

-- src:96 | em, Quyền lợi bảo hiểm khi tử vong sẽ giảm theo
-- src:98 | tỷ lệ phần trăm của số tiền bảo hiểm (không bao
-- One arm per row of the table, in the table's order. The bands overlap ("Dưới 2 tuổi" also covers
-- an Age under 1); they are read as a first-match ladder, each row taking the Ages the row above
-- leaves (fork F8). The table's Age is the Age at death in the Art 1.4 sense (Age at the last
-- birthday), so "Dưới 1 tuổi" is Age 0. "trẻ em" is not defined; the last row gives 100% from Age 4,
-- so the table decides every Age and the word decides nothing.
-- The reduction is of the sum insured only, not of the rider benefits ("không bao gồm quyền lợi
-- của các điều khoản bảo hiểm bổ trợ"), and (iii) is still deducted after it (fork F9).
@ref Art 3(b), src:94-126
GIVEN `the Age at death` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 3(b) — the percentage of the sum insured for an Age at death of` `the Age at death` MEANS
  BRANCH
    -- src:108 | Dưới 1 tuổi
    -- src:110 | 20% của số tiền bảo hiểm
    IF `the Age at death` LESS THAN 1 THEN 20%
    -- src:112 | Dưới 2 tuổi
    -- src:114 | 40% của số tiền bảo hiểm
    IF `the Age at death` LESS THAN 2 THEN 40%
    -- src:116 | Dưới 3 tuổi
    -- src:118 | 60% của số tiền bảo hiểm
    IF `the Age at death` LESS THAN 3 THEN 60%
    -- src:120 | Dưới 4 tuổi
    -- src:122 | 80% của số tiền bảo hiểm
    IF `the Age at death` LESS THAN 4 THEN 80%
    -- src:124 | Từ 4 tuổi trở lên
    -- src:126 | 100% của số tiền bảo hiểm
    OTHERWISE 100%

§§ `Art 3(c) — exclusions from the death benefit`

-- src:133 | vong nếu tử vong xảy ra do kết quả trực tiếp hay
-- src:137 | Phạm tội hoặc cố tình phạm tội hình sự;
-- src:141 | Bất kỳ sự tử vong nào do liên quan đến Hội
-- src:144 | AIDS (ARC), hoặc nhiễm vi rút (virus) gây
-- src:145 | suy giảm miễn dịch ở người (HIV);
-- Two causes, each reached "directly or indirectly". (i) names nobody as the one who commits the
-- crime. Taken: the insured's own crime (fork F6, and Law 08/2022/QH15 Art 24 reads an unclear term
-- in the policyholder's favour). The literal reading, under which a death caused by anyone's crime is
-- excluded, is finding 1, and vn11-findings.l4 runs it. The first limb, "Phạm tội", has no
-- "cố tình" (intentionally), so a crime of negligence is inside it (finding 2).
-- (ii) "do liên quan đến" (related to) is recorded as found, not computed (finding 9).
@ref Art 3(c), src:132-145
GIVEN `the death` IS A `The death`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 3(c) — the death benefit is excluded for` `the death` MEANS
        "(i)"  ... `the death`'s `resulting directly or indirectly from the insured committing a crime, or intentionally committing a criminal offence`
    OR  "(ii)" ... `the death`'s `related to AIDS, an AIDS-related condition (ARC), or HIV infection`

§§ `Art 3(c), last sentence — the premium refunded`

-- src:171 | Công ty sẽ hoàn lại 100% số phí bảo hiểm, không
-- src:172 | có lãi, sau khi khấu trừ các chi phí và phí tổn phát
-- The same words close Art 9 (src:252-254) and Art 11 (src:282-284), and all three use this rule.
-- "100% số phí bảo hiểm" is read as 100% of the premium paid (fork F10). "không có lãi": no interest
-- is added. The document gives no criteria for the reasonable costs (finding 7) and does not say
-- what follows if they exceed the premium; the refund is not taken below nil (fork F10).
@ref Art 3(c), src:171-173; Art 9, src:252-254; Art 11, src:282-284
GIVEN `the total premium paid`            IS A NUMBER
      `the reasonable costs and expenses` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the premium refunded, without interest, after the reasonable costs` `the total premium paid` `the reasonable costs and expenses` MEANS
    max 0 (100% TIMES `the total premium paid` MINUS `the reasonable costs and expenses`)
